-app&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":525},{"title":"sn\\_opty\\_mgmt\\_core.opportunity\\_contributor role to create and view opportunities.\n\n-   **Google Maps APIs for Field Service Capabilities**\n\nUpgrade to the new Places API \\(new\\) and Routes API for Field Service Capabilities.\n\nEffective March 1, 2025, Google has designated the Places API, Directions API, and Distance Matrix API as Legacy services. The newer versions of these services are Places API \\(New\\) and Routes API.\n\nYou can’t enable or generate new API keys for these legacy services. However, you can continue using these services with the existing API keys. Enable the new APIs from Google Console to continue using the API services without any issues.\n\nIf you create a new Google API key after March 1, 2025, enable the new APIs from Google Console to use these services with the new API keys.\n\nFor more information see, [KB2111488","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/nav_to.do?uri=kb_knowledge.do?sys_id=3b86844293516210f538fb2d6cba10bf","line":531},{"title":"Changes to Google Maps Platform automatic volume discounts, monthly credit, and services transitioning to Legacy status","target":"https://developers.google.com/maps/billing-and-pricing/faq#legacy","line":543},{"title":"KB2112054","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/nav_to.do?uri=kb_knowledge.do?sys_id=47952c8a93556210f538fb2d6cba1026","line":543},{"title":"Capacity and Reservations Management","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=configuring-capacity-management&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":552},{"title":"Google Maps APIs for  Field Service  capabilities","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=google-maps-api-keys&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":556},{"title":"Smart Assessment for Field Service","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=configuring-smart-assessment-questionnaire&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":560},{"title":"Field Service Scheduling","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=setting-up-scheduling-methods&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":569},{"title":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=external.sn-app-store&amp;family=australia&amp;ft:locale=en-US","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=external.sn-app-store&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":580},{"title":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=external.sn-app-store&amp;family=australia&amp;ft:locale=en-US","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=external.sn-app-store&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":584},{"title":"Advanced Appointment Booking","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=appintment-booking-day-level-config&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":586},{"title":"Field Service Contractor Management","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=configuring-fsm-contractor-management&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":587},{"title":"Field Service Marketplace","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=configuring-contractor-marketplace&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":588},{"title":"Field Service Territory Planning","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=configuring-territory-planning-fsm&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":589},{"title":"Field Service Capacity and Reservations Management","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=configuring-capacity-management&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":591},{"title":"Field Service with Service Locations Support","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=Configuring-service-location&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":592},{"title":"Technician driven sales with Field Service","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=create-opportunity&family=australia&ft:locale=en-US","line":593},{"title":"Schedule Optimization","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?contex